    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>By standing your ground, you focus your mind to repel any assault.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Base Attack Bonus\">Base Attack Bonus</a> +1</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fight_Defensively\" title=\"Fight Defensively\">Fight Defensively</a>, you gain a +2 morale bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a>. If you make no attacks until your next turn, you gain a +5 morale bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Will_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will Defense\">Will Defense</a> until the start of your next turn.</p><p><b>Normal:</b> When you <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fight_Defensively\" title=\"Fight Defensively\">Fight Defensively</a> you only get a dodge bonus to your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Reflex_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex Defense\">Reflex Defense</a>.</p>",
